* ADG711 Analog Switch Circuit
.lib ADG711.sub

* 5V Power Supply
Vdd VDD 0 5V

* 2V DC Input Signal
Vin IN 0 2V

* Control signal
* The ADG711 is a normally closed (NC) switch. 
* A logic low (0V) on the control pin closes the switch.
Vctrl CTRL 0 0V

* ADG711 Switch Instance
* Typical ADI SPST subcircuit pinout: Source, Drain, Control_In, VDD, GND
X1 IN OUT CTRL VDD 0 ADG711

* 10k Load Resistor
Rload OUT 0 10k

* Transient analysis to allow the DC output to settle and be measured
.tran 1m

.end
